# {{alternative spelling of|Hangeul|lang=en}}

====Usage notes====
* The spelling {{m|en|hangeul}}/{{m|en|Hangeul}} is from the Korean spelling in the 1959-SK transcription and the 2000 South Korean Revised transcription. ''Hangul'' derives from the older {{l|en|McCune-Reischauer}} transcription ''hangŭl'' written without the diacritics: it is the more common English spelling. Within the English Wiktionary, ''hangeul'' is preferred.